{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0026-s001", "text": "När en person flyttar in i en hyresbostad ska hen ingå ett skriftligt hyresavtal om bostaden med hyresvärden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0026-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.47374149659864, "peak": 0.236663818359375, "generation_seconds": 30.707238893955946, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0026-s002", "text": "Hyresavtalet kan vara tidsbegränsat eller gälla tills vidare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0026-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.50312925170068, "peak": 0.301971435546875, "generation_seconds": 18.91775278095156, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0027-s001", "text": "Ett tidsbegränsat hyresavtal gäller för en viss tid, till exempel ett år.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0027-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.478367346938776, "peak": 0.288909912109375, "generation_seconds": 21.673886087955907, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0027-s002", "text": "Det upphör automatiskt och kan vanligtvis inte sägas upp mitt under avtalsperioden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0027-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.174965986394557, "peak": 0.2972412109375, "generation_seconds": 23.481913103954867, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0027-s003", "text": "Det kan anges i avtalet att avtalet efter den bestämda tidsperioden fortsätter att gälla tills vidare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0027-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.6378231292517, "peak": 0.364349365234375, "generation_seconds": 23.160768131026998, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0028-s001", "text": "Ett hyresavtal som gäller tills vidare fortsätter tills den boende eller hyresvärden säger upp det.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0028-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.359183673469389, "peak": 0.281280517578125, "generation_seconds": 23.69859363208525, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0028-s002", "text": "Om den boende säger upp avtalet är uppsägningstiden en månad.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0028-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.642448979591837, "peak": 0.25933837890625, "generation_seconds": 21.389247565995902, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0028-s003", "text": "Om bostadens ägare säger upp avtalet är uppsägningstiden 3–6 månader.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0028-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.523265306122449, "peak": 0.266326904296875, "generation_seconds": 30.74848810583353, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0028-s004", "text": "Ofta anges det i tillsvidareavtal att avtalet kan sägas upp tidigast efter en viss tid, till exempel tolv månader.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0028-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.891700680272109, "peak": 0.293548583984375, "generation_seconds": 44.51615245407447, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0029-s001", "text": "Uppsägningstid betyder den tidsperiod som hyresgästen ännu får bo i bostaden efter att hyresavtalet har sagts upp.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0029-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.752380952380953, "peak": 0.322662353515625, "generation_seconds": 37.53410458914004, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0029-s002", "text": "Hyresgästen måste betala hyra för uppsägningstiden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0029-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.667210884353741, "peak": 0.272857666015625, "generation_seconds": 21.907665631035343, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0029-s003", "text": "Meddelandet om uppsägning ska alltid göras skriftligt, till exempel per e-post.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0029-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.244625850340136, "peak": 0.37738037109375, "generation_seconds": 20.753840340068564, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0029-s004", "text": "Vid en eventuell tvist måste man kunna bevisa att meddelandet har levererats.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0029-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.6873469387755105, "peak": 0.290374755859375, "generation_seconds": 17.8085925350897, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0029-s005", "text": "Därför är det bra att begära ett kvitto på e-postmeddelandet som bekräftar att det har blivit läst.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0029-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.359183673469389, "peak": 0.29827880859375, "generation_seconds": 23.38469805009663, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0030-s001", "text": "Det är bra att veta att uppsägningstiden oftast börjar räknas från slutet av den kalendermånad då avtalet sägs upp.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0030-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.961360544217687, "peak": 0.30859375, "generation_seconds": 26.463113852078095, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0030-s002", "text": "Det betyder att om hyresgästen säger upp hyresavtalet under mars månad, måste hen betala hyra ännu för april.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0030-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.05578231292517, "peak": 0.29449462890625, "generation_seconds": 30.37491650809534, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0030-s003", "text": "Så här är det oavsett om meddelandet om uppsägning skickas i början eller slutet av månaden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0030-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.289523809523809, "peak": 0.258392333984375, "generation_seconds": 23.984577764989808, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0031-s001", "text": "Det är bra att använda en standardmall för hyresavtal.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0031-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.015510204081632, "peak": 0.40087890625, "generation_seconds": 13.917354955105111, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0031-s002", "text": "En sådan är lätt att hitta på internet och innehåller åtminstone följande:", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0031-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.617687074829932, "peak": 0.282928466796875, "generation_seconds": 20.633282577851787, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0032-s001", "text": "personuppgifter och adresser för bostadens ägare och hyresgästen", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0032-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.851428571428571, "peak": 0.290557861328125, "generation_seconds": 20.697053116047755, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0034-s001", "text": "bostadens adress, typ, storlek, skick och utrustning (det vill säga vilka saker som finns i bostaden)", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0034-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.334421768707482, "peak": 0.309967041015625, "generation_seconds": 30.11890547000803, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0035-s001", "text": "när hyresavtalet börjar gälla och när det upphör", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0035-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.597551020408163, "peak": 0.263092041015625, "generation_seconds": 17.990741043817252, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0036-s001", "text": "beloppet av hyran och garantihyran i euro", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0036-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.1099319727891155, "peak": 0.335540771484375, "generation_seconds": 18.030884954845533, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0037-s001", "text": "när hyran ska betalas och till vilket bankkonto", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0037-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.388571428571429, "peak": 0.342498779296875, "generation_seconds": 22.22935792291537, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0038-s001", "text": "vad som ingår i hyran och vad man måste betala extra för (till exempel vatten, el eller bilplats)", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0038-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.05578231292517, "peak": 0.36358642578125, "generation_seconds": 32.26623385795392, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0039-s001", "text": "villkoren för hyreshöjning, det vill säga på vilka villkor bostadens ägare kan höja hyran en gång per år.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0039-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.986122448979591, "peak": 0.257781982421875, "generation_seconds": 36.668434066930786, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0040-s001", "text": "I allmänhet måste man betala en hyresgaranti för bostaden innan man flyttar in.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0040-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.757006802721088, "peak": 0.347381591796875, "generation_seconds": 26.271936390083283, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0040-s002", "text": "Hyresgaranti betyder att den som hyr bostaden betalar extra pengar i förväg till hyresvärden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0040-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.219863945578231, "peak": 0.309356689453125, "generation_seconds": 35.16843459894881, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0040-s003", "text": "För bostäder som ägs av privata hyresvärdar motsvarar garantin i allmänhet ett par månaders hyra.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0040-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.846802721088435, "peak": 0.300201416015625, "generation_seconds": 27.696496829856187, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0040-s004", "text": "Hyresgarantin får inte vara större än tre månaders hyra.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0040-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.085170068027211, "peak": 0.26068115234375, "generation_seconds": 15.913877499988303, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0040-s005", "text": "Företag som äger många bostäder kräver ofta en mindre garanti.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0040-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.712108843537415, "peak": 0.28460693359375, "generation_seconds": 16.129767097067088, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0041-s001", "text": "Garantin betalas tillbaka när man flyttar ut, om bostaden är i bra skick och den boende har betalat hyrorna i tid.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0041-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.682721088435374, "peak": 0.288055419921875, "generation_seconds": 25.49088613386266, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0041-s002", "text": "Om den boende inte betalar sin hyra eller om det krävs reparationer i bostaden, kan hyresvärden behålla en del av eller hela garantin.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0041-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.563537414965987, "peak": 0.286865234375, "generation_seconds": 34.328730506123975, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0041-s003", "text": "Hyresvärden kan inte behålla garantin för sådana spår efter den boende som beror på normalt slitage.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0041-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.568163265306122, "peak": 0.256866455078125, "generation_seconds": 19.755250373855233, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0042-s001", "text": "Om hyresgästen avsiktligen eller på grund av ovarsamt beteende har orsakat skador i bostaden som det kostar mer att reparera än vad garantin täcker, kan hyresvärden kräva extra ersättning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0042-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 16.16108843537415, "peak": 0.276580810546875, "generation_seconds": 47.22074107802473, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0043-s001", "text": "Hyresgarantin kan inte användas för att betala hyran för de sista månaderna.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0043-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.757006802721088, "peak": 0.2906494140625, "generation_seconds": 28.02956195990555, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0044-s001", "text": "Ofta ska du betala en vattenavgift för bostaden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0044-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.458231292517007, "peak": 0.37518310546875, "generation_seconds": 20.50928311701864, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0044-s002", "text": "Betala vattenavgiften till hyresvärdens eller husbolagets konto på samma gång som du betalar hyra.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0044-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.289523809523809, "peak": 0.3515625, "generation_seconds": 30.584187862928957, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0044-s003", "text": "Beloppet på vattenavgiften beror ofta på det antal personer som bor i bostaden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0044-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.757006802721088, "peak": 0.379974365234375, "generation_seconds": 30.13240104680881, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0044-s004", "text": "Om det finns en vattenmätare i bostaden, fastställs vattenavgiften enligt vattenkonsumtionen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0044-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.219863945578231, "peak": 0.443817138671875, "generation_seconds": 29.486403848044574, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0045-s001", "text": "Ofta ska du själv ingå ett elavtal.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0045-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.6919727891156464, "peak": 0.331939697265625, "generation_seconds": 19.558661836897954, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0045-s002", "text": "Du ingår ett elavtal genom att ringa ett elbolag och uppge ditt namn och din nya adress.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0045-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.453605442176871, "peak": 0.28546142578125, "generation_seconds": 28.426772228907794, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0045-s003", "text": "Om du vill hitta det förmånligaste priset, kan du jämföra olika elbolags priser.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0045-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.453605442176871, "peak": 0.26800537109375, "generation_seconds": 28.476046388037503, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0046-s001", "text": "Om bostaden har centralvärme, ingår uppvärmningen i allmänhet i hyran.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0046-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.548027210884354, "peak": 0.276031494140625, "generation_seconds": 21.004162629833445, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0046-s002", "text": "Om bostaden har oljevärme eller elvärme, ska avgiften ibland betalas separat.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0046-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.174965986394557, "peak": 0.302032470703125, "generation_seconds": 25.427218589000404, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0047-s001", "text": "Det kostar i allmänhet att använda husbolagets bastu, tvättstuga och bilplatser.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0047-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.1053061224489795, "peak": 0.44110107421875, "generation_seconds": 21.825278853066266, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0047-s002", "text": "I allmänhet ska dessa avgifter betalas direkt till husbolaget.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0047-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.642448979591837, "peak": 0.358612060546875, "generation_seconds": 19.140386410057545, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0048-s001", "text": "Om du bor på hyra i ett egnahemshus, ska du ofta betala för uppvärmningen och avfallshanteringen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0048-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.568163265306122, "peak": 0.2889404296875, "generation_seconds": 28.133528545033187, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0049-s001", "text": "I Finland bor många människor i hyresbostäder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0049-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.388571428571429, "peak": 0.287261962890625, "generation_seconds": 17.404672138858587, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0049-s002", "text": "Det som är bra med en hyresbostad är att det är lätt att byta bostad, eftersom du inte behöver sälja och köpa bostaden.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0049-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.170340136054422, "peak": 0.269744873046875, "generation_seconds": 25.20171934599057, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0049-s003", "text": "Men å andra sidan kan hyresvärden bestämma sig för att säga upp hyresavtalet, om han eller hon har en godtagbar anledning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0049-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.379319727891156, "peak": 0.332305908203125, "generation_seconds": 26.76281676394865, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c11-u0049-s004", "text": "Då måste du flytta från hyresbostaden, även om du inte vill det.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c11-hyresavtal/narration/hb-c11-u0049-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.642448979591837, "peak": 0.328094482421875, "generation_seconds": 20.1718353680335, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
